<!-- modem-research-2026-11-09.aiml — CETI modem technology research batch, 2026-11-09.
     7 topics, researched and distilled by the local LFM3 via the Hub research
     pipeline; every fact/QA below was verified against a source actually fetched
     that day before approval (fact-gate). Unverified proposals were left
     pending and are NOT in this file; duplicates were dropped, not shipped twice.
     Distill notes: task 21 (V.32bis) first parse failed on LFM3 JSON escapes
     (invalid \' escapes, trailing commas) — repaired by sanitizing the raw
     output. Task 22 (V.34) facts were salvaged item-by-item from malformed JSON;
     the lost facts were hand-extracted from the verified report. Task 24
     (Hayes AT) had one drifted Fidonet fact — quarantined as pending, not shipped.
     Task 26 (timeline) dropped 11 distilled items as duplicates of tasks 20-25
     or the existing cassettes; its new ground is the 212A/V.32 dates, the DS0
     56k ceiling, and the dial-up decline / AOL shutdown.
